BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_316246142@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260919T042226Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260919T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260919T120000
SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Saturdays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nJoin us for
  friendly and sociable free rallies and possibly some informal matches for
  training and fun. We are beginner to intermediate levels but all are welc
 ome. We don’t allow formal instruction on our group-reserved courts\, al
 though giving some quick tips is OK so long as you’re not holding up oth
 ers waiting to play.\n\n⛑️ **Clinic Matches:** If we have to rotate pe
 ople in then we may play some clinic-style matches where everyone rotates 
 in evenly. There is no holding the court via wins so everyone has a chance
  to play regardless of skill level.\n\n🕊️ **Early Bird Start:** If yo
 u want to meet earlier than 9 AM (like 8 or 8:30) then please let us know 
 by the day before and we’ll see who can join you (usually I can do earli
 er).\n\n**🎾 Equipment:** Please bring your own racquet and water\, as w
 e don’t provide those. I always have some balls for at least one court\,
  but feel free to bring your own in case we need to branch out over more t
 han one court.\n\n**🧯DISCLAIMER:** Courts are subject to availability a
 nd weather. If you make plans to attend please be prepared to cancel or ad
 just our location as needed. Furthermore\, by attending you agree to be fu
 lly responsible for your own health and safety. Each person is responsible
  to take a break for rest and water at their own discretion.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316246142/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260823T224221Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260823T224221Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_316245854@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260919T042226Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260919T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260919T180000
SUMMARY:Adult Kickball - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nCome join u
 s for two to three hours of kickball.\n\nThe event is scheduled for Columb
 us Park\, 71 W Franklin St\, Hackensack\, because it has a huge grass fiel
 d.\n\nWe'll grab a kickball\, some bases and split up into teams to play. 
 Comment below if you have your own to bring. There are a ton of parking sp
 aces on West Franklin Street.\n\n\\*\\*\\*After playing\, we'll likely be 
 heading to Tropical Juice Bar\, 60 River St.\, Hackensack. Feel free to su
 ggest another spot to hang out if you've got one in mind. \\*\\*\\*\n\nThe
 re's no fee to play and nothing else you need to do besides show up. Come 
 anytime!! All are welcome!!! We're not in a league and are not here to ana
 lyze your form. We're here for people who haven't played in months\, maybe
  years\, and just want to play again and/or hang out.\n\nHope you'll join 
 us for our 5th kickball event. Questions or comments? You can message Andy
  on Meetup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9609.\n\n\\*\\*\\* We are looking
  into some other spots for future kickball games. If you have ideas\, feel
  free to share. \\*\\*\\*\n\nCheck out bowling\, soccer\, volleyball\, ten
 nis\, skating or one of our other activities at: [www.meetup.com/north-jer
 sey-bowling-soccer-volleyball](https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling
 -soccer-volleyball)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316245854/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260823T220653Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260823T220653Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
