DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nIf you’re
  close then stop by for lunch and half-price games. For socializing\, netw
 orking\, and having fun\, so all are welcome! Pool\, food\, drinks\, and 
 ½ price games.
